Incomplete drawing verdict
==========================
Old: partial stage-2 HTML/SVG set status=wrong and degraded the whole account.
New: partial stage-2 output is analyzed normally but marked interrupted and
source_complete=false. The UI writes “输出被中断，分析可能错误”.

With stage 1 enabled, the text answer is authoritative for the account verdict,
consecutive counters, recovery and degraded-group switching. Stage-2 code-match
score/signals remain visible. With stage 1 disabled, interruption is uncertain.
Complete failed streams remain operational errors. Empty failed records remain
filtered from the public panel.

Degraded-account API
====================
GET /api/v1/admin/account-quality/degraded-accounts is an admin-only read API.
It scans current OAuth quality metadata and the latest persisted quality state,
returns only OpenAI/Gemini OAuth records, and emits email/account_id plus a
reason. HTTP 401/Unauthorized text from account ErrorMessage, quality history,
or quality state is included as reason=unauthorized with http_status=401. API Key
and service-account accounts are excluded. Missing email returns an empty string
without dropping the account. The API uses the standard {code,message,data}
envelope and is documented in docs/ACCOUNT_QUALITY_DEGRADED_ACCOUNTS_API.md.

The API includes 401 diagnostics as data (`http_status=401`) while preserving
HTTP 401 for callers that fail admin authentication. Current account metadata
and latest persisted quality state are both checked so a 401 remains visible
when the run snapshot and account error field differ.
